### 3. Create a New Transaction Entry (Replace userId with the ID generated from step 2)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "INCOME",
  "amount": 42200.00,
  "category": "Salary",
  "description": "Initial project milestone release payout",
  "userId": "a1144b30-2b0e-4acb-83b8-f8ab09b6e921"
}

